1
00:00:00,133 --> 00:00:01,901
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

2
00:00:02,331 --> 00:00:03,483
DON'T TOUCH ME!

3
00:00:03,483 --> 00:00:05,906
BARNEY: I think you dropped this
back in Black Mesa.

4
00:00:05,906 --> 00:00:09,321
Right on! Now, just give me a
ski mask and we're good to go.

5
00:00:09,321 --> 00:00:11,164
[microwave beeping]

6
00:00:11,164 --> 00:00:12,334
Ha-haa!
SCIENTIST: My God!

7
00:00:18,816 --> 00:00:22,434
Oh, yeah! All Mars, all the time!

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,200
So, these are drugs, right?
Only one really fast way to find out.

9
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:30,972
Aaaaahhh...

10
00:00:30,972 --> 00:00:32,267
WHOO-HOO-HOO!

11
00:00:34,659 --> 00:00:37,534
So. We meet at last.

12
00:00:38,385 --> 00:00:40,546
[crying]

13
00:00:40,546 --> 00:00:43,109
Hey, I want a raise; I just
saved the Statue of Liberty.

14
00:00:43,109 --> 00:00:43,980
MAN: I've got work to do.

15
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:44,806
DID YOU HEAR ME?

16
00:00:44,806 --> 00:00:47,067
I SAID THE STATUE OF LIB--

17
00:00:49,626 --> 00:00:52,000
Look! A rock! It's amazing!

18
00:00:52,915 --> 00:00:57,434
This is my bucket. There are
many like it, but this one's mine.

19
00:00:57,922 --> 00:01:00,300
GET OFF THE ROAD, YOU STUPID GIT!

20
00:01:03,406 --> 00:01:04,234
Ah, good.

21
00:01:04,831 --> 00:01:08,943
Now, I need you to
listen to me very carefully.

22
00:01:08,943 --> 00:01:12,534
You are to address me as DOCTOR Freeman.

23
00:01:13,154 --> 00:01:15,534
I think I might be color blind.

24
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:18,901
Who's a good doggy? Are you?

25
00:01:19,228 --> 00:01:21,000
WAAAAHHH-AAAAH-AAAAAAAAAH!

26
00:01:23,647 --> 00:01:26,534
JESUS! MARDI GRAS IS
FUCKING CRAZY THIS YEAR!

27
00:01:27,091 --> 00:01:28,834
Bee-de-beep-de-beep-bop-beep-bop.

28
00:01:29,327 --> 00:01:32,767
I don't understand. There's no
known physics model for this.

29
00:01:33,567 --> 00:01:34,500
Unless...

30
00:01:34,982 --> 00:01:37,133
OH MY GOD! I'M TWO-DIMENSIONAL!

31
00:01:50,799 --> 00:01:53,100
Mm! Kat-Patty.

